{
  "_": [
    "The guardian's modifier in a guild expedition of Audacia (166-185) or Bravura (186-205).",
    "",
    "It is a plain spell the boss holds from the start, not an idol. Each boss has two in the",
    "client's spells: adminName 'Initial <boss> Expedition 1 - Fun' (icon 14947, state 3501",
    "'Expedicion de Audacia') and '... - Hard' (icon 14948, state 3500 'Expedicion de Bravura');",
    "their first grade puts the state and chains the rest through 792. Nothing in the data ties a",
    "dungeon to its spell but the boss's name in the adminName, so the pairs are written here:",
    "the normal dungeon's boss (datos/dungeons.json) matched to the adminName by its French name.",
    "Merkator's, read against Dofus pour les noobs: Audacia shares the damage among the monsters",
    "and adds 2% final damage per hit; Bravura keeps him invulnerable and gives 1 MP each time",
    "he becomes vulnerable. War has two Hard spells with the same effects (23910, 24252): the",
    "later one is taken. The plain expeditions (143-162) have no modifier."
